r delivery flow to ensure that when we make","tokens":[50680,4985,6921,11,8568,613,382,257,644,295,527,8982,3095,281,5586,300,562,321,652,50934],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.24122217297554016,"compression_ratio":1.5644444227218628,"no_speech_prob":0.10374121367931366},{"id":52,"seek":20808,"start":219.47999572753906,"end":223.1199951171875,"text":" code changes, mistakes aren't made that break other things.","tokens":[50934,3089,2962,11,8038,3212,380,1027,300,1821,661,721,13,51116],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.24122217297554016,"compression_ratio":1.5644444227218628,"no_speech_prob":0.10374121367931366},{"id":53,"seek":20808,"start":223.1199951171875,"end":230.47999572753906,"text":" So this is a confidence mechanism that we've put in place with traditional software.","tokens":[51116,407,341,307,257,6687,7513,300,321,600,829,294,1081,365,5164,4722,13,51484],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.24122217297554016,"compression_ratio":1.5644444227218628,"no_speech_prob":0.10374121367931366},{"id":54,"seek":20808,"start":230.47999572753906,"end":232.0399932861328,"text":" The agents are probabilistic.","tokens":[51484,440,12554,366,31959,3142,13,51562],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.24122217297554016,"compression_ratio":1.5644444227218628,"no_speech_prob":0.10374121367931366},{"id":55,"seek":23204,"start":232.0399932861328,"end":237.63999938964844,"text":" And so the same request can produce different answers.","tokens":[50364,400,370,264,912,5308,393,5258,819,6338,13,50644],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.222882941365242,"compression_ratio":1.4759358167648315,"no_speech_prob":0.01566322147846222},{"id":56,"seek":23204,"start":237.63999938964844,"end":242.0800018310547,"text":" More than one answer may be acceptable.","tokens":[50644,5048,813,472,1867,815,312,15513,13,50866],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.222882941365242,"compression_ratio":1.4759358167648315,"no_speech_prob":0.01566322147846222},{"id":57,"seek":23204,"start":242.0800018310547,"end":248.8800048828125,"text":" And we still need evidence, but exact output comparisons alone really aren't good enough.","tokens":[50866,400,321,920,643,4467,11,457,1900,5598,33157,3312,534,3212,380,665,1547,13,51206],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.222882941365242,"compression_ratio":1.4759358167648315,"no_speech_prob":0.01566322147846222},{"id":58,"seek":23204,"start":248.8800048828125,"end":256.9200134277344,"text":" We need to build representative datasets and evaluate them and define what good looks like.","tokens":[51206,492,643,281,1322,12424,42856,293,13059,552,293,6964,437,665,1542,411,13,51608],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.222882941365242,"compression_ratio":1.4759358167648315,"no_speech_prob":0.01566322147846222},{"id":59,"seek":25692,"start":256.9200134277344,"end":262.5199890136719,"text":" We need to run these evaluations in repeated series.","tokens":[50364,492,643,281,1190,613,43085,294,10477,2638,13,50644],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.283203125,"compression_ratio":1.6741071939468384,"no_speech_prob":0.001325014978647232},{"id":60,"seek":25692,"start":262.5199890136719,"end":270.1600036621094,"text":" And this is a statistical analysis, right, where we actually look at the outputs in volume","tokens":[50644,400,341,307,257,22820,5215,11,558,11,689,321,767,574,412,264,23930,294,5523,51026],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.283203125,"compression_ratio":1.6741071939468384,"no_speech_prob":0.001325014978647232},{"id":61,"seek":25692,"start":270.1600036621094,"end":274.20001220703125,"text":" and not just as a direct comparison.","tokens":[51026,293,406,445,382,257,2047,9660,13,51228],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.283203125,"compression_ratio":1.6741071939468384,"no_speech_prob":0.001325014978647232},{"id":62,"seek":25692,"start":274.20001220703125,"end":280.20001220703125,"text":" So combining with evals as sort of your runtime logs of what happened, or sorry, traces, which","tokens":[51228,407,21928,365,1073,1124,382,1333,295,428,34474,20820,295,437,2011,11,420,2597,11,26076,11,597,51528],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.283203125,"compression_ratio":1.6741071939468384,"no_speech_prob":0.001325014978647232},{"id":63,"seek":25692,"start":280.20001220703125,"end":286.8800048828125,"text":" are sort of your runtime logs of what happens, we've built this confidence mechanism to complement,","tokens":[51528,366,1333,295,428,34474,20820,295,437,2314,11,321,600,3094,341,6687,7513,281,17103,11,51862],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.283203125,"compression_ratio":1.6741071939468384,"no_speech_prob":0.001325014978647232},{"id":64,"seek":28688,"start":286.8800048828125,"end":292.8800048828125,"text":" to complement traditional software.","tokens":[50364,281,17103,5164,4722,13,50664],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.26374369859695435,"compression_ratio":1.4825870990753174,"no_speech_prob":0.0022870188113301992},{"id":65,"seek":28688,"start":292.8800048828125,"end":296.7200012207031,"text":" And ultimately, this is what we're going to be talking about a little bit more in terms","tokens":[50664,400,6284,11,341,307,437,321,434,516,281,312,1417,466,257,707,857,544,294,2115,50856],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.26374369859695435,"compression_ratio":1.4825870990753174,"no_speech_prob":0.0022870188113301992},{"id":66,"seek":28688,"start":296.7200012207031,"end":300.6000061035156,"text":" of driving confidence in the output, not only putting this mechanism in place, but how do","tokens":[50856,295,4840,6687,294,264,5598,11,406,787,3372,341,7513,294,1081,11,457,577,360,51050],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.26374369859695435,"compression_ratio":1.4825870990753174,"no_speech_prob":0.0022870188113301992},{"id":67,"seek":28688,"start":300.6000061035156,"end":307.9599914550781,"text":" we begin to turn it on.","tokens":[51050,321,1841,281,1261,309,322,13,51418],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.26374369859695435,"compression_ratio":1.4825870990753174,"no_speech_prob":0.0022870188113301992},{"id":68,"seek":28688,"start":307.9599914550781,"end":311.0,"text":" So where does the agent belong?","tokens":[51418,407,689,775,264,9461,5784,30,51570],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.26374369859695435,"compression_ratio":1.4825870990753174,"no_speech_prob":0.0022870188113301992},{"id":69,"seek":28688,"start":311.0,"end":313.0,"text":" Back to the lending example.","tokens":[51570,5833,281,264,29823,1365,13,51670],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.26374369859695435,"compression_ratio":1.4825870990753174,"no_speech_prob":0.0022870188113301992},{"id":70,"seek":31300,"start":313.0,"end":319.2799987792969,"text":" We can do KYC financials in parallel and sequence a credit memo, risk review, documentation,","tokens":[50364,492,393,360,41150,34,4669,82,294,8952,293,8310,257,5397,35900,11,3148,3131,11,14333,11,50678],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.2512284517288208,"compression_ratio":1.6176470518112183,"no_speech_prob":0.052611663937568665},{"id":71,"seek":31300,"start":319.2799987792969,"end":323.0400085449219,"text":" decision, all these things in our DAG.","tokens":[50678,3537,11,439,613,721,294,527,9578,38,13,50866],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.2512284517288208,"compression_ratio":1.6176470518112183,"no_speech_prob":0.052611663937568665},{"id":72,"seek":31300,"start":323.0400085449219,"end":327.6000061035156,"text":" Looking at each node, we want to ask some certain questions, like how valuable would","tokens":[50866,11053,412,1184,9984,11,321,528,281,1029,512,1629,1651,11,411,577,8263,576,51094],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.2512284517288208,"compression_ratio":1.6176470518112183,"no_speech_prob":0.052611663937568665},{"id":73,"seek":31300,"start":327.6000061035156,"end":333.67999267578125,"text":" it be to have an agent drive this node versus a human drive this node?","tokens":[51094,309,312,281,362,364,9461,3332,341,9984,5717,257,1952,3332,341,9984,30,51398],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.2512284517288208,"compression_ratio":1.6176470518112183,"no_speech_prob":0.052611663937568665},{"id":74,"seek":31300,"start":333.67999267578125,"end":337.44000244140625,"text":" And we can sort of look at some of these basic questions, like can we check it against the","tokens":[51398,400,321,393,1333,295,574,412,512,295,613,3875,1651,11,411,393,321,1520,309,1970,264,51586],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.2512284517288208,"compression_ratio":1.6176470518112183,"no_speech_prob":0.052611663937568665},{"id":75,"seek":31300,"start":337.44000244140625,"end":338.760009765625,"text":" policy easily?","tokens":[51586,3897,3612,30,51652],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.2512284517288208,"compression_ratio":1.6176470518112183,"no_speech_prob":0.052611663937568665},{"id":76,"seek":31300,"start":338.760009765625,"end":340.55999755859375,"text":" Can it run in a bounded loop?","tokens":[51652,1664,309,1190,294,257,37498,6367,30,51742],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.2512284517288208,"compression_ratio":1.6176470518112183,"no_speech_prob":0.052611663937568665},{"id":77,"seek":31300,"start":340.55999755859375,"end":341.760009765625,"text":" Can we trace it?","tokens":[51742,1664,321,13508,309,30,51802],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.2512284517288208,"compression_ratio":1.6176470518112183,"no_speech_prob":0.052611663937568665},{"id":78,"seek":34176,"start":341.760009765625,"end":343.760009765625,"text":" Can we fall back to a human?","tokens":[50364,1664,321,2100,646,281,257,1952,30,50464],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.19452029466629028,"compression_ratio":1.5637860298156738,"no_speech_prob":0.00831536203622818},{"id":79,"seek":34176,"start":343.760009765625,"end":349.20001220703125,"text":" If we can answer yes to these type of questions, we can kind of have a good idea going in that","tokens":[50464,759,321,393,1867,2086,281,613,2010,295,1651,11,321,393,733,295,362,257,665,1558,516,294,300,50736],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.19452029466629028,"compression_ratio":1.5637860298156738,"no_speech_prob":0.00831536203622818},{"id":80,"seek":34176,"start":349.20001220703125,"end":353.2799987792969,"text":" this particular node may be better suited for automation.","tokens":[50736,341,1729,9984,815,312,1101,24736,337,17769,13,50940],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.19452029466629028,"compression_ratio":1.5637860298156738,"no_speech_prob":0.00831536203622818},{"id":81,"seek":34176,"start":353.2799987792969,"end":357.4599914550781,"text":" But throughout the DAG, we should look to drive agent assistance.","tokens":[50940,583,3710,264,9578,38,11,321,820,574,281,3332,9461,9683,13,51149],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.19452029466629028,"compression_ratio":1.5637860298156738,"no_speech_prob":0.00831536203622818},{"id":82,"seek":34176,"start":357.4599914550781,"end":361.32000732421875,"text":" So what we're really talking about is not whether or not AI is involved, but whether","tokens":[51149,407,437,321,434,534,1417,466,307,406,1968,420,406,7318,307,3288,11,457,1968,51342],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.19452029466629028,"compression_ratio":1.5637860298156738,"no_speech_prob":0.00831536203622818},{"id":83,"seek":34176,"start":361.32000732421875,"end":370.1199951171875,"text":" or not AI we expect to take over at some point.","tokens":[51342,420,406,7318,321,2066,281,747,670,412,512,935,13,51782],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.19452029466629028,"compression_ratio":1.5637860298156738,"no_speech_prob":0.00831536203622818},{"id":84,"seek":37012,"start":370.1199951171875,"end":374.3399963378906,"text":" On the decision, you would probably agree that we probably need that to be human-driven.","tokens":[50364,1282,264,3537,11,291,576,1391,3986,300,321,1391,643,300,281,312,1952,12,25456,13,50575],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.2518659234046936,"compression_ratio":1.567685604095459,"no_speech_prob":0.0166560560464859},{"id":85,"seek":37012,"start":374.3399963378906,"end":377.70001220703125,"text":" This is essentially the check against the policy.","tokens":[50575,639,307,4476,264,1520,1970,264,3897,13,50743],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.2518659234046936,"compression_ratio":1.567685604095459,"no_speech_prob":0.0166560560464859},{"id":86,"seek":37012,"start":377.70001220703125,"end":384.79998779296875,"text":" So this is going to be a little bit more difficult, I think, to hill climb.","tokens":[50743,407,341,307,516,281,312,257,707,857,544,2252,11,286,519,11,281,10997,10724,13,51098],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.2518659234046936,"compression_ratio":1.567685604095459,"no_speech_prob":0.0166560560464859},{"id":87,"seek":37012,"start":384.79998779296875,"end":386.9599914550781,"text":" But what do we mean by hill climb?","tokens":[51098,583,437,360,321,914,538,10997,10724,30,51206],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.2518659234046936,"compression_ratio":1.567685604095459,"no_speech_prob":0.0166560560464859},{"id":88,"seek":37012,"start":386.9599914550781,"end":389.760009765625,"text":" How do we turn this on?","tokens":[51206,1012,360,321,1261,341,322,30,51346],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.2518659234046936,"compression_ratio":1.567685604095459,"no_speech_prob":0.0166560560464859},{"id":89,"seek":37012,"start":389.760009765625,"end":398.2799987792969,"text":" So day one, we start supervised, and as we have agents and humans working together as","tokens":[51346,407,786,472,11,321,722,46533,11,293,382,321,362,12554,293,6255,1364,1214,382,51772],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.2518659234046936,"compression_ratio":1.567685604095459,"no_speech_prob":0.0166560560464859},{"id":90,"seek":39828,"start":398.2799987792969,"end":407.67999267578125,"text":" a part of the process, we can manually verify the output to ensure that it is of high quality.","tokens":[50364,257,644,295,264,1399,11,321,393,16945,16888,264,5598,281,5586,300,309,307,295,1090,3125,13,50834],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.23403532803058624,"compression_ratio":1.6337448358535767,"no_speech_prob":0.0022169724106788635},{"id":91,"seek":39828,"start":407.67999267578125,"end":412.5400085449219,"text":" This is where we refine our data sets and ensure that we have the right confidence mechanisms","tokens":[50834,639,307,689,321,33906,527,1412,6352,293,5586,300,321,362,264,558,6687,15902,51077],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.23403532803058624,"compression_ratio":1.6337448358535767,"no_speech_prob":0.0022169724106788635},{"id":92,"seek":39828,"start":412.5400085449219,"end":413.79998779296875,"text":" in place.","tokens":[51077,294,1081,13,51140],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.23403532803058624,"compression_ratio":1.6337448358535767,"no_speech_prob":0.0022169724106788635},{"id":93,"seek":39828,"start":413.79998779296875,"end":418.0799865722656,"text":" We've defined what good looks like with the domain subject matter experts, and that they're","tokens":[51140,492,600,7642,437,665,1542,411,365,264,9274,3983,1871,8572,11,293,300,436,434,51354],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.23403532803058624,"compression_ratio":1.6337448358535767,"no_speech_prob":0.0022169724106788635},{"id":94,"seek":39828,"start":418.0799865722656,"end":422.94000244140625,"text":" beginning to verify it.","tokens":[51354,2863,281,16888,309,13,51597],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.23403532803058624,"compression_ratio":1.6337448358535767,"no_speech_prob":0.0022169724106788635},{"id":95,"seek":39828,"start":422.94000244140625,"end":427.9599914550781,"text":" When measured confidence reaches a policy threshold, we can move towards sampling.","tokens":[51597,1133,12690,6687,14235,257,3897,14678,11,321,393,1286,3030,21179,13,51848],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.23403532803058624,"compression_ratio":1.6337448358535767,"no_speech_prob":0.0022169724106788635},{"id":96,"seek":42796,"start":428.6400146484375,"end":432.20001220703125,"text":" And what that means is humans are looking at a slice of the output and not necessarily","tokens":[50398,400,437,300,1355,307,6255,366,1237,412,257,13153,295,264,5598,293,406,4725,50576],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.2335795760154724,"compression_ratio":1.6867469549179077,"no_speech_prob":0.0013885113876312971},{"id":97,"seek":42796,"start":432.20001220703125,"end":433.8800048828125,"text":" all of it.","tokens":[50576,439,295,309,13,50660],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.2335795760154724,"compression_ratio":1.6867469549179077,"no_speech_prob":0.0013885113876312971},{"id":98,"seek":42796,"start":433.8800048828125,"end":441.4800109863281,"text":" We begin more systematic evaluation through traces in order to ensure that what the humans","tokens":[50660,492,1841,544,27249,13344,807,26076,294,1668,281,5586,300,437,264,6255,51040],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.2335795760154724,"compression_ratio":1.6867469549179077,"no_speech_prob":0.0013885113876312971},{"id":99,"seek":42796,"start":441.4800109863281,"end":446.79998779296875,"text":" aren't seeing is still meeting the quality bar.","tokens":[51040,3212,380,2577,307,920,3440,264,3125,2159,13,51306],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.2335795760154724,"compression_ratio":1.6867469549179077,"no_speech_prob":0.0013885113876312971},{"id":100,"seek":42796,"start":446.79998779296875,"end":451.1600036621094,"text":" And then finally, once we clear the confidence threshold, humans handle more of the exceptions","tokens":[51306,400,550,2721,11,1564,321,1850,264,6687,14678,11,6255,4813,544,295,264,22847,51524],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.2335795760154724,"compression_ratio":1.6867469549179077,"no_speech_prob":0.0013885113876312971},{"id":101,"seek":42796,"start":451.1600036621094,"end":456.760009765625,"text":" of the process, but still act as participants in refining the data sets and ensuring the","tokens":[51524,295,264,1399,11,457,920,605,382,10503,294,1895,1760,264,1412,6352,293,16882,264,51804],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.2335795760154724,"compression_ratio":1.6867469549179077,"no_speech_prob":0.0013885113876312971},{"id":102,"seek":45676,"start":456.760009765625,"end":460.0,"text":" quality outputs.","tokens":[50364,3125,23930,13,50526],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.3523463010787964,"compression_ratio":1.4879226684570312,"no_speech_prob":0.012429959140717983},{"id":103,"seek":45676,"start":460.0,"end":468.9599914550781,"text":" Okay, so a few takeaways from this.","tokens":[50526,1033,11,370,257,1326,45584,490,341,13,50974],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.3523463010787964,"compression_ratio":1.4879226684570312,"no_speech_prob":0.012429959140717983},{"id":104,"seek":45676,"start":468.9599914550781,"end":475.44000244140625,"text":" DAG and DCG, basic graph theory, but ultimately, how do we build these processes that exist","tokens":[50974,9578,38,293,9114,38,11,3875,4295,5261,11,457,6284,11,577,360,321,1322,613,7555,300,2514,51298],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.3523463010787964,"compression_ratio":1.4879226684570312,"no_speech_prob":0.012429959140717983},{"id":105,"seek":45676,"start":475.44000244140625,"end":480.6000061035156,"text":" today and where people are working them and bring agents into the mix?","tokens":[51298,965,293,689,561,366,1364,552,293,1565,12554,666,264,2890,30,51556],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.3523463010787964,"compression_ratio":1.4879226684570312,"no_speech_prob":0.012429959140717983},{"id":106,"seek":45676,"start":480.6000061035156,"end":485.79998779296875,"text":" And the recipe really is to keep it deterministic on the outside and make it adaptive on the","tokens":[51556,400,264,6782,534,307,281,1066,309,15957,3142,322,264,2380,293,652,309,27912,322,264,51816],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.3523463010787964,"compression_ratio":1.4879226684570312,"no_speech_prob":0.012429959140717983},{"id":107,"seek":48580,"start":485.8399963378906,"end":493.239990234375,"text":" inside.","tokens":[50366,1854,13,50736],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.26931819319725037,"compression_ratio":1.407185673713684,"no_speech_prob":0.0008295872830785811},{"id":108,"seek":48580,"start":493.239990234375,"end":495.79998779296875,"text":" The next is quality through evaluation.","tokens":[50736,440,958,307,3125,807,13344,13,50864],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.26931819319725037,"compression_ratio":1.407185673713684,"no_speech_prob":0.0008295872830785811},{"id":109,"seek":48580,"start":495.79998779296875,"end":502.2799987792969,"text":" And this is really establishing a complementary confidence mechanism.","tokens":[50864,400,341,307,534,22494,257,40705,6687,7513,13,51188],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.26931819319725037,"compression_ratio":1.407185673713684,"no_speech_prob":0.0008295872830785811},{"id":110,"seek":48580,"start":502.2799987792969,"end":504.5199890136719,"text":" So it's not a feeling about a model.","tokens":[51188,407,309,311,406,257,2633,466,257,2316,13,51300],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.26931819319725037,"compression_ratio":1.407185673713684,"no_speech_prob":0.0008295872830785811},{"id":111,"seek":48580,"start":504.5199890136719,"end":514.8400268554688,"text":" We can actually provide research and statistics about the quality of our agents.","tokens":[51300,492,393,767,2893,2132,293,12523,466,264,3125,295,527,12554,13,51816],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.26931819319725037,"compression_ratio":1.407185673713684,"no_speech_prob":0.0008295872830785811},{"id":112,"seek":51484,"start":514.8800048828125,"end":521.9199829101562,"text":" So this builds confidence and inherently trusts output.","tokens":[50366,407,341,15182,6687,293,27993,45358,5598,13,50718],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.34090352058410645,"compression_ratio":1.4137930870056152,"no_speech_prob":0.002323111519217491},{"id":113,"seek":51484,"start":521.9199829101562,"end":524.0399780273438,"text":" Quality is a team sport.","tokens":[50718,28892,307,257,1469,7282,13,50824],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.34090352058410645,"compression_ratio":1.4137930870056152,"no_speech_prob":0.002323111519217491},{"id":114,"seek":51484,"start":524.0399780273438,"end":533.3599853515625,"text":" AI engineers own the pipeline to taking product signals from all directions and deliver applications","tokens":[50824,7318,11955,1065,264,15517,281,1940,1674,12354,490,439,11095,293,4239,5821,51290],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.34090352058410645,"compression_ratio":1.4137930870056152,"no_speech_prob":0.002323111519217491},{"id":115,"seek":51484,"start":533.3599853515625,"end":540.8400268554688,"text":" that are well-built and utilize ML operations behind the scenes.","tokens":[51290,300,366,731,12,23018,293,16117,21601,7705,2261,264,8026,13,51664],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.34090352058410645,"compression_ratio":1.4137930870056152,"no_speech_prob":0.002323111519217491},{"id":116,"seek":54084,"start":541.8400268554688,"end":550.760009765625,"text":" Finally, agents accelerate across the operating model.","tokens":[50414,6288,11,12554,21341,2108,264,7447,2316,13,50860],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.3322239816188812,"compression_ratio":1.3661972284317017,"no_speech_prob":0.0006770610343664885},{"id":117,"seek":54084,"start":550.760009765625,"end":557.280029296875,"text":" I've included some references on the final slide, things that I've spoken about today.","tokens":[50860,286,600,5556,512,15400,322,264,2572,4137,11,721,300,286,600,10759,466,965,13,51186],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.3322239816188812,"compression_ratio":1.3661972284317017,"no_speech_prob":0.0006770610343664885},{"id":118,"seek":54084,"start":557.280029296875,"end":559.239990234375,"text":" This concludes my presentation.","tokens":[51186,639,24643,452,5860,13,51284],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.3322239816188812,"compression_ratio":1.3661972284317017,"no_speech_prob":0.0006770610343664885},{"id":119,"seek":54084,"start":559.239990234375,"end":560.239990234375,"text":" Thank you very much.","tokens":[51284,1044,291,588,709,13,51334],"temperature":0.0,"avg_logprob":-0.3322239816188812,"compression_ratio":1.3661972284317017,"no_speech_prob":0.0006770610343664885},{"id":120,"seek":56024,"start":560.6400146484375,"end